		"nextNodeId": 80,
		"nodes": {
			"19": {
				"attributes": {
					"alignment": {
						"type": "integer",
						"value": 0
					},
					"fill": {
						"type": "bool",
						"value": true
					},
					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "TIMELINE\nThe Timeline node can be used to create a value that ramps from its start to end value over a set duration. This ramp can be looped (creating a sort of oscillator). The interesting part about the Timeline is that it has options to play, pause, stop, rewind and restart the value like you would with a piece of footage. Play starts the modulation. Pause pauses the modulation, sending out the current value indefinitely. Stop stops the modulation and sets it back to its start value. Restart resets the value to the start value and starts playback. Rewind does the same except it respects the current mode. If paused it works like a stop, if playing it works like a restart.\n\n- Patch Explained -\n\n• We have custom triggers for each item in the first timeline.\n• Both Timelines run from -1 to 1 over the duration of 5 seconds.\n• The bottom Timeline is looped.\n• The Timelines modulate the X and Y position of the circle."
					}
				},
				"bounds": {
					"height": 274.17047119140625,
					"width": 1032.3973388671875,
					"x": 502.169464111328125,
					"y": -68.9745330810546875
				},
				"class": {
					"id": "77697265-3C1D-467D-A722-0FC566538374",
					"version": 1
				},
				"clock": "video",
				"color": "ffd0c117",
				"constants": {},
				"hidden": [
					"text",
					"alignment",
					"font-size",
					"fill"
				],
				"name": "Comment"
			},
			"21": {
				"attributes": {
					"alignment": {
						"type": "integer",
						"value": 0
					},
					"fill": {
						"type": "bool",
						"value": true
					},
					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "OUTLETS\n\n• Main\nOutputs a float.\n\n"
					}
				},
				"bounds": {
					"height": 380,
					"width": 334,
					"x": 856.15618896484375,
					"y": 920.43914794921875
				},
				"class": {
					"id": "77697265-3C1D-467D-A722-0FC566538374",
					"version": 1
				},
				"clock": "video",
				"color": "ffd0c117",
				"constants": {},
				"hidden": [
					"text",
					"alignment",
					"font-size",
					"fill"
				],
				"name": "Comment"
			},
			"22": {
				"attributes": {
					"alignment": {
						"type": "integer",
						"value": 0
					},
					"fill": {
						"type": "bool",
						"value": true
					},
					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "INLETS\n\n• Play\nInput a trigger to start playback.\n\n• Pause\nInput a trigger to pause playback.\n\n• Stop\nInput a trigger to stop playback.\n\n• Restart\nInput a trigger to reset to the Start Value and start playback.\n\n• Rewind\nInput a trigger to rewind back to the Start Value. Does not change the playback mode.\n\n• Duration\nInput a float  to set the duration over which to ramp (in seconds).\n\n• Start Value\nInput a float to set the starting position of the Timeline.\n\n• End Value\nInput a float to set the end position of the Timeline.\n\n• Loop\nInput a bool to toggle between loop and oneshot mode."
					}
				},
				"bounds": {
